   - The values `n0` and `n1` come from the `tnaf0` and `tnaf1` arrays
   - The code accesses `t[n0/2]` and `t1[n1/2]` without bounds checking
   - If `n0/2` or `n1/2` exceeds `(1 << (EB_WIDTH - 2)) - 1`, this will cause out-of-bounds access

